        <mxCell id="t71" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#222222;fontSize=11;lineSpacing=3;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="• Each application domain owns and manages its database boundary.&lt;br&gt;• No cross-database foreign keys are created.&lt;br&gt;• Cross-database relationships are logical references only." vertex="1">
